  "non_duplication_rules": [
    "SSP owns system topology; FMI owns component execution interface; do not create a parallel proprietary topology graph.",
    "SSP-LS-Traceability carries simulation-process traceability context; GeoFusion retains source/carrier/boundary/interval/allocation semantics.",
    "BagIt owns package completeness and manifest-level checksums; runtime source verifier owns semantic source-receipt checks.",
    "RO-Crate owns research-object context; PROV-O owns graph semantics; do not duplicate either.",
    "DSSE/in-toto signer and trust policy remains owned by #5560; signatures never upgrade scientific evidence class."
